 plans (filled from 6:45 to 4:30 around your meetings, with Devotions at 8:00, Break at 10:05 and Lunch at 12:20), Fill, and sessions you add yourself. A block list can include Freedom blocklists (Block lists page), so Freedom runs with every focus session too. Remove a list from any session while planning your day. These are the same on all your synced computers."/><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                        <Button x:Name="DefaultAppsBtn" Click="DefaultApps_Click" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                        <Button x:Name="DefaultListsBtn" Click="DefaultLists_Click"/>
                    </StackPanel><CheckBox x:Name="AutoStartWorkdaysCheck" Margin="0,12,0,0" Content="Start my plan automatically every workday"/></StackPanel><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,28,0,0"><Button Content="Save changes" Style="{StaticResource PrimaryButton}" Click="SaveSettingsPage_Click" Margin="0,0,16,0" ToolTip="Changes save by themselves; this saves straight away"/><Button Content="Reset this page" Tag="planning" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Margin="0" Click="ResetSettingsPage_Click" ToolTip="Put this page's settings back to how they started" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></StackPanel></StackPanel><StackPanel x:Name="SettingsPage_sessions" Tag="sessions" Visibility="Collapsed"><TextBlock Text="Focus sessions" Style="{StaticResource Heading}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/><Border Background="{DynamicResource Panel2}" CornerRadius="10" Padding="14,10" Margin="0,8,0,4"><DockPanel><Button Content="Open Freedom…" Click="OpenFreedom_Click" DockPanel.Dock="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="12,0,0,0" ToolTip="Connect Freedom, choose blocklists and devices, start a session"/><StackPanel><TextBlock Text="Freedom" FontWeight="SemiBold" FontSize="14"/><TextBlock x:Name="FreedomSettingsSummary" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,2,0,0"/></StackPanel></DockPanel></Border><StackPanel Tag="section"><TextBlock Text="Default lengths" Style="{StaticResource SubHeading}" Margin="0,26,0,4"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,0,0,12" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="Used for new sessions and breaks. Sessions already in your plan keep their own lengths."/><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
